{
  "scenario": "The General Data Protection Regulation, Regulation (EU) 2016/679, as published in the Official Journal: its English and French expressions and their PDF and XHTML formats, three of its articles, the 2018 corrigendum and the consolidated version that includes it, and the Data Protection Directive 95/46/EC it repealed. Beside it are the Law Enforcement Directive (EU) 2016/680, adopted the same day, and Ireland's Data Protection Act 2018, which transposes the directive and ensures the implementation of the regulation. Subdivision types and versions come from an example table, as ELI leaves them to each publisher; the other concepts come from the EU authority tables and ELI's own.",
